  "guidance": "> Added **v0.6**\n\nThe Akeneo connector supports write to a PIM product list\n\n### Write\n### Recipe\n```yaml\nwrite:\n  - akeneo:\n      host: https://akeneo.example.com\n      user: user\n      password: password\n      client_id: client_id\n      client_secret: client_secret\n      source: products\n      columns:\n        - column1\n        - column2\n```\n\n### Function\n```python\nfrom wrangles.connectors import akeneo\nakeneo.write(\n      df,\n      user='user',\n      password='password',\n      host='https://akeneo.example.com',\n      client_id='client_id',\n      client_secret='client_secret',\n      source='products',\n)\n```"
